PROCESS: Competitive CO2 Methane Nitrogen Adsorption on 13X
VERSION: 1.0
ONLINE_LOOKUP: false
THERMO_METHOD: PR
DESCRIPTION: All three gases have NIST-derived isotherms and compete on 100 kg/h of fresh 13X.

COMPONENTS:
    CO2 | Carbon dioxide | MW=44.0095
    CH4 | Methane | MW=16.04246
    N2 | Nitrogen | MW=28.0134

STREAM Feed : -> MS.feed
    T = 313 [K]
    P = 1 [bar]
    F = 1 [kmol/h]
    x = CO2:0.2, CH4:0.1, N2:0.7

STREAM Product : MS.product
STREAM Adsorbate : MS.adsorbate

UNIT MS : MolecularSieveDryer
    sieve_type = 13X
    adsorbent_mass_flow = 100 [kg/h]
